-- Brief candidate summaries researched from first-party sources on 2026-10-22.
-- Provenance and previous descriptions: docs/research/2026-11-03-candidate-summaries.json
-- Replace missing or exact imported descriptions; preserve subsequent admin edits.
-- All other person fields and election relationships remain unchanged.
