  ('fitz-johnson', 'Listed on the printed ballot as Republican. Candidate for Georgia Public Service Commissioner, District 3 (statewide vote), in the November 3, 2026 election. Source: Macon-Bibb Board of Elections composite sample ballot, October 15 revision. Verified October 21, 2026.', 'Fitz Johnson is a businessman, Army veteran, and former public service commissioner campaigning for affordable, reliable utilities.'),
