  ('kelly-esti', 'Listed on the printed ballot as Democrat. Candidate for United States House of Representatives, Georgia District 8, in the November 3, 2026 election. Source: Macon-Bibb Board of Elections composite sample ballot, October 15 revision. Verified October 21, 2026.', 'Kelly Esti is a Navy veteran and small business co-owner running for Congress with priorities including education, health care, and veterans.'),
